---
// Static inline SVG, site tokens only, no ids/markers. All values come from the code shown next to the figure in the post.
---
<figure class="gp7u">
  <div class="gp7u-scroll">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 900 306" role="img" aria-label="Two timelines of an unbuffered channel. In each, whichever side arrives first waits until the other side arrives; then the value passes and both continue.">
<text x="20" y="24" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>The sender arrives first</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Bên gửi tới trước</tspan></text>
<text x="20" y="63" class="lane"><tspan data-lang-en>sender</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>bên gửi</tspan></text>
<text x="20" y="119" class="lane"><tspan data-lang-en>receiver</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>bên nhận</tspan></text>
<rect class="bar" x="150" y="46" width="150" height="24" rx="3"/>
<text x="225.0" y="63.0" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>runs</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>chạy</tspan></text>
<rect class="wait" x="300" y="46" width="200" height="24" rx="3"/>
<text x="400.0" y="63.0" class="mute" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>waits at ch &lt;- "ping"</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>chờ ở ch &lt;- "ping"</tspan></text>
<rect class="bar" x="500" y="46" width="260" height="24" rx="3"/>
<text x="630.0" y="63.0" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>continues</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>chạy tiếp</tspan></text>
<rect class="bar" x="150" y="102" width="350" height="24" rx="3"/>
<text x="325.0" y="119.0" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>runs, then reaches &lt;-ch</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>chạy, rồi tới &lt;-ch</tspan></text>
<rect class="bar" x="500" y="102" width="260" height="24" rx="3"/>
<text x="630.0" y="119.0" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>continues</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>chạy tiếp</tspan></text>
<line class="vline" x1="500" y1="40" x2="500" y2="132"/>
<text x="512" y="90" class="strong"><tspan data-lang-en>they meet, the value passes</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>gặp nhau, giá trị được chuyển</tspan></text>
<text x="20" y="174" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>The receiver arrives first</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Bên nhận tới trước</tspan></text>
<text x="20" y="213" class="lane"><tspan data-lang-en>sender</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>bên gửi</tspan></text>
<text x="20" y="269" class="lane"><tspan data-lang-en>receiver</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>bên nhận</tspan></text>
<rect class="bar" x="150" y="196" width="350" height="24" rx="3"/>
<text x="325.0" y="213.0" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>runs, then reaches ch &lt;- "ping"</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>chạy, rồi tới ch &lt;- "ping"</tspan></text>
<rect class="bar" x="500" y="196" width="260" height="24" rx="3"/>
<text x="630.0" y="213.0" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>continues</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>chạy tiếp</tspan></text>
<rect class="bar" x="150" y="252" width="150" height="24" rx="3"/>
<text x="225.0" y="269.0" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>runs</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>chạy</tspan></text>
<rect class="wait" x="300" y="252" width="200" height="24" rx="3"/>
<text x="400.0" y="269.0" class="mute" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>waits at &lt;-ch</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>chờ ở &lt;-ch</tspan></text>
<rect class="bar" x="500" y="252" width="260" height="24" rx="3"/>
<text x="630.0" y="269.0" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>continues</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>chạy tiếp</tspan></text>
<line class="vline" x1="500" y1="190" x2="500" y2="282"/>
<text x="512" y="240" class="strong"><tspan data-lang-en>they meet, the value passes</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>gặp nhau, giá trị được chuyển</tspan></text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption><span data-lang-en>Whichever side arrives first waits. Only when both are at the channel does the value pass, and then both continue. Bar lengths are illustrative.</span><span data-lang-vi>Bên nào tới trước thì chờ. Chỉ khi cả hai cùng ở channel thì giá trị mới được chuyển, rồi cả hai chạy tiếp. Độ dài thanh chỉ để minh họa.</span></figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .gp7u { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .gp7u-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .gp7u svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .gp7u text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .gp7u .h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .gp7u .lane { fill: var(--text-muted); font-weight: 600; }
  .gp7u .bar { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .gp7u .wait { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; stroke-dasharray: 4 3; }
  .gp7u .bad { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.2; stroke-dasharray: 4 3; }
  .gp7u .badtx { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .gp7u .mute { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .gp7u .strong { fill: var(--text); font-weight: 600; }
  .gp7u .vline { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .gp7u .vline.red { stroke: var(--red); }
  .gp7u .grid { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .gp7u .arrow { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .gp7u .num { font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .gp7u figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
